  "changes": [
    "Catalog-owned exact Mistral OCR 4.0 offering, fixed USD page rate, and inference-only OCR protocol.",
    "Provider request selects exactly the locally counted PDF pages, without annotation or batch options.",
    "Measured page settlement survives missing or invalid page text. Missing or invalid counts retain uncertain capacity.",
